  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1608.02 Application Form. The applicant shall complete and submit the \"Application for a Septage Land Application (Site) Permit\" form, NHDES-W-09-040, May 2026, available at: https://onlineforms.nh.gov/?formtag=NHDES-W-09-040.\n\nSource. #13944, eff 4-27-24; ss by #14205, EXRF, eff 2-27-25; ss by #14572, EXRF, eff 5-15-26, EXPIRES: 5-15-36",
